B.VU=new A.aY(B.bi,["Wanjiku Mwangi","Nairobi, Kenya","SORA made finding my dream home in Nairobi effortless! Their agents were incredibly helpful and knew the market inside out. Highly recommend to anyone looking for a property in Kenya."],t.l)
