B.W3=new A.aY(B.bi,["Mwangi wa Macharia","Mirema Drive, Nairobi","SORA's deep knowledge of Mirema Drive properties was a game-changer. They showed us listings that perfectly fit our family's needs and budget. We love our new home!"],t.l)
B.W9=new A.aY(B.bi,["Emily Muringo","Mirema Drive, Nairobi","The process of acquiring our new commercial space on Mirema Drive was handled with pure professionalism. SORA is the go-to for anyone seeking property in this bustling area."],t.l)
B.VZ=new A.aY(B.bi,["Linet Chege","Westlands, Nairobi","SORA helped us find and furnish the perfect Airbnb apartment in Westlands. Their insights into the short-term rental market are unmatched. Our bookings are through the roof!"],t.l)
B.Wa=new A.aY(B.bi,["Sammy Okoth","Kilimani, Nairobi","Investing in an Airbnb unit in Kilimani was a great decision, and it wouldn't have been possible without SORA. They handled everything from identifying the property to tenant management. A top real estate company in Kenya for sure."],t.l)
B.W5=new A.aY(B.bi,["Chebet Kiprono","Nakuru, Kenya","We were looking for a high-yield rental property in Nakuru. SORA delivered a gem! The team is responsive, and their property management services are fantastic. Thank you for helping us grow our portfolio."],t.l)
B.W6=new A.aY(B.bi,["Victor Njoroge","Kilimani, Nairobi","I was looking for a modern Airbnb apartment for a short stay. SORA's listings were detailed and the booking process was seamless. The property was exactly as described. So happy with my experience!"],t.l)
B.VY=new A.aY(B.bi,["Monica Moraa","Lavington, Nairobi","The team at SORA truly understands the Airbnb market. They helped me find a property with high rental potential in a prime area like Lavington. My investment is already paying off."],t.l)
